# The Emissary Windurst (Bastok 2-3, mission.bastok.the_emissary_windurst). A level 30 Warrior of Bastok in Port
# Windurst with the mission current (a GM; a GM's Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1's first mission out). Status 0: Ada
# 51, Gold Skull 50, Josef 52, Melek 49. With the Sword Offering and no Dull Sword: Gold Skull 53, whose finish gives
# the Dull Sword and takes the offering; with both, Gold Skull's status arm answers 50. Status 3: Gold Skull 50.
# Status 4: Gold Skull 54, Melek 49. Status 5: Melek 49. Status 7: neither arm answers, so the zone defaults play
# (Gold Skull 43, Melek 42). Status 6: Gold Skull 54, Melek 55, whose finish completes the mission, begins The
# Emissary and moves to status 7.
lists Giddeus/Uu_Zhoumo/onTrigger Giddeus/Uu_Zhoumo/onTrade Giddeus/onEventFinish/40 Giddeus/onEventFinish/41 HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onZoneIn/1 HeavensTower/onEventUpdate/42 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/42 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/239 NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger PortWindurst/Ada/onTrigger PortWindurst/Gold_Skull/onTrigger PortWindurst/Josef/onTrigger PortWindurst/Melek/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/53 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/55
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-80,-5,158 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissaryWindurst current
login
trigger Ada
finish-if-event
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Josef
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
keyitem SwordOffering
trigger Gold_Skull
finish
keyitem SwordOffering
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
delkeyitem SwordOffering
missionstatus Bastok 3
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 4
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 5
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 7
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 6
trigger Gold_Skull
finish-if-event
trigger Melek
finish
